{"schemaVersion":1,"generatedAt":"2026-08-16T16:20:46.501Z","id":"42fd49ac6bb22ade5eed2d35","canonicalUrl":"https://lore.kernel.org/r/20260808-stmmac-ets-offload-v3-0-b714466142b9%40oss.qualcomm.com/","channels":["linux-arm-kernel"],"thread":{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"thread:lore-git:20260808-stmmac-ets-offload-v3-0-b714466142b9@oss.qualcomm.com","source":{"kind":"static-generated","canonicalThreadUrl":"https://lore.kernel.org/r/20260808-stmmac-ets-offload-v3-0-b714466142b9%40oss.qualcomm.com/","fetchedAt":"2026-08-16T16:20:46.501Z","contentDigest":"lore-git:20260808-stmmac-ets-offload-v3-0-b714466142b9@oss.qualcomm.com"},"subject":"Re: [PATCH net-next v3 2/3] net: stmmac: add tc-mqprio qdisc offload","messages":{"aoEcjrBy6h7E22dI@lore-qca":{"id":"aoEcjrBy6h7E22dI@lore-qca","messageId":"aoEcjrBy6h7E22dI@lore-qca","references":["20260808-stmmac-ets-offload-v3-0-b714466142b9@oss.qualcomm.com","20260808-stmmac-ets-offload-v3-2-b714466142b9@oss.qualcomm.com","20260814135631.766ceb41@kernel.org"],"missingAncestorIds":["20260814135631.766ceb41@kernel.org","20260808-stmmac-ets-offload-v3-2-b714466142b9@oss.qualcomm.com","20260808-stmmac-ets-offload-v3-0-b714466142b9@oss.qualcomm.com"],"author":{"name":"Lorenzo Bianconi","address":"lorenzo.bianconi@oss.qualcomm.com"},"sender":{"name":"linux-arm-kernel","address":"linux-arm-kernel-bounces@lists.infradead.org"},"replyTo":[],"to":[{"name":"Jakub Kicinski","address":"kuba@kernel.org"}],"cc":[{"name":"Maxime Chevallier","address":"maxime.chevallier@bootlin.com"},{"name":"Andrew Lunn","address":"andrew+netdev@lunn.ch"},{"name":"David S. Miller","address":"davem@davemloft.net"},{"name":"Eric Dumazet","address":"edumazet@google.com"},{"name":"Paolo Abeni","address":"pabeni@redhat.com"},{"name":"Maxime Coquelin","address":"mcoquelin.stm32@gmail.com"},{"name":"Alexandre Torgue","address":"alexandre.torgue@foss.st.com"},{"name":"Daniel Thompson","address":"daniel@riscstar.com"},{"name":"Alex Elder","address":"elder@riscstar.com"},{"name":"Davide Caratti","address":"dcaratti@redhat.com"},{"name":"","address":"netdev@vger.kernel.org"},{"name":"","address":"linux-stm32@st-md-mailman.stormreply.com"},{"name":"","address":"linux-arm-kernel@lists.infradead.org"}],"timestamp":{"raw":"2026-08-16T02:12:30.000Z","iso":"2026-08-16T02:12:30.000Z","valid":true},"subject":"Re: [PATCH net-next v3 2/3] net: stmmac: add tc-mqprio qdisc offload","mailingLists":[{"id":"linux-arm-kernel.lists.infradead.org","displayName":"linux-arm-kernel.lists.infradead.org","address":"linux-arm-kernel@lists.infradead.org"}],"blocks":[{"kind":"quote","lines":[{"depth":1,"text":"On Sat, 08 Aug 2026 16:49:58 +0200 Lorenzo Bianconi wrote:"},{"depth":1,"text":"> Subject: [PATCH net-next v3 2/3] net: stmmac: add tc-mqprio qdisc offload"},{"depth":1,"text":"> "},{"depth":1,"text":"> Implement offload of the tc-mqprio qdisc in the stmmac driver. The MTL TX"},{"depth":1,"text":"> scheduler is switched to strict priority, and the PSTQX/PSTC priority"},{"depth":1,"text":"> bitmask of each TX queue is programmed from the set of frame priorities"},{"depth":1,"text":"> mapped to the owning traffic class (qopt->prio_tc_map)."},{"depth":1,"text":"> "},{"depth":1,"text":"> The offload requires the DCB feature and a 1:1 TC to TX queue mapping,"},{"depth":1,"text":"> with the queue ranges bounded by the number of queues the MAC implements."},{"depth":1,"text":"> Configurations with AVB queues are rejected, since forcing strict"},{"depth":1,"text":"> priority conflicts with the CBS algorithm."},{"depth":1,"text":""},{"depth":1,"text":"Clashiko has a bunch of comments, I assume at least one of them is"},{"depth":1,"text":"actionable. High level - you say \"add tc-mqprio qdisc offload\""},{"depth":1,"text":"but the driver already has a bunch of mqprio code. Background"},{"depth":1,"text":"would be useful. You also say \"1:1 TC to TX queue mapping\", if there's"},{"depth":1,"text":"only one queue per priority why offload mqprio and not prio?"},{"depth":1,"text":"At least a note in the commit message would be useful."}],"lineCount":19,"maximumDepth":1},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"ack, thx. I will address them in v4."},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Regards,\nLorenzo"}],"patchIds":[],"attachmentMetadata":[{"filename":"signature.asc","contentType":"application/pgp-signature","disposition":"unknown","contentOmitted":true}],"sourceOrdinal":0,"diagnostics":[],"declaredParentMessageId":"20260814135631.766ceb41@kernel.org"}},"rootIds":["aoEcjrBy6h7E22dI@lore-qca"],"childrenByParent":{},"chronologicalIds":["aoEcjrBy6h7E22dI@lore-qca"],"patchSeries":[],"diagnostics":[],"patches":{}}}